pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">-</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">하계어학과정 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">(Ulpan)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">-</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">학위과정</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">연구과정</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">나</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">기본 자격 요건</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">1) </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">한국 국적 소지자로서 </span><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">만 </span></u><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">35</span></u><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">세 미만</span></u><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">인자 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">지원 과정이 시작될 때 기준</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">2) </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">문학사 또는 이학사 이상의 학위 소지자로서</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">학업성적이 우수한 자</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">3) </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">영어 또는 히브리어 실력을 갖춘 자 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">4) </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">지원하는 이스라엘 대학이 요구하는 학업요건을 갖춘 자</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">,</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">다</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">장학 조건</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">1) </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">부분장학금은 의료보험료와 등록금 또는 생활비 지급</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">학위 과정중 일년</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">총 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">8</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">개월간 지급</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">2) </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">전액장학금은 의료보험료</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">등록금</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">생활비 모두 지급</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">3) </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">숙박비</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">교통비</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">항공료 등은 본인 부담</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">※</span><span style=\"FONT-STYLE: italic; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">장학금 지급 조건은 이스라엘정부 예산사정에 따라 매년 달라질 수 있음</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">라</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">이스라엘 정부가 지정한 대학에 지원하는 경우에만 장학금이 지급됨</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-INDENT: 17.5pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">각 대학별로 장학금 지급이 다를 수 있으므로 확인 바람</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">) </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; MARGIN-LEFT: 53.2pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">※ </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">이스라엘정부장학생 수용 주요 대학 목록</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; MARGIN-LEFT: 53.2pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">Tel Aviv University, The Hebrew University, Haifa University, Bar Ilan University, Ben-Gurion University, Technion, Bezalel School for Art, the Volcani Center/Agricultural Research Organization, and the Weizmann Institute.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; MARGIN-LEFT: 53.2pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">* Summer Ulpan</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">은 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">Haifa University Ulpan</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">만 가능함</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-INDENT: 10.6pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">장학금 지급 가능 대학 전체 목록</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">붙임 안내</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">웹 사이트 참조</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">마</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">제출 서류 및 기타 사항</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">첨부 참조 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">※</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">붙임</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">2. 2015 </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">이스라엘 정부초청장학생 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">DB</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">는 파일 송부 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagi